OL,3,GNEWSA#846k fund to get people off
OL,4,Acity's streets by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust under #850,000 has been given to
OL,7,FManchester to get people sleeping rough
OL,8,Foff the streets by Christmas.
OL,10,FThe money was handed down by the
OL,11,Fgovernment, and comes after Prime
OL,12,FMinister Andy Burnham pledged to end
OL,13,Frough sleeping across the country.
OL,15,FManchester City Council plans to give
OL,16,Fthe money to organisations that work
OL,17,Fwith homeless people to help them find
OL,18,Fa "route off the streets".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
