OL,3,GNEWSA#846k fund to get people off
OL,4,Acity's streets by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FFigures published in March showed that
OL,7,Fthe number of people sleeping rough in
OL,8,FManchester had increased on the
OL,9,Fprevious 12 months.
